{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中央軍委副主席張升民表示，中國願同俄羅斯探索合作的新亮點，更好捍衛各自國家主權和安全。</p><p></p><p>中央軍委副主席張升民周二在北京，會見俄羅斯國防部長別洛烏索夫。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RUS-2300-1_CLEAN_20261103_211538.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026712KAkh8p81793712048.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>張升民說，在國家主席習近平與俄羅斯總統普京戰略引領下，中俄關係進入更有作為、更快發展的新階段。</p><p></p><p>他說近年來中俄兩軍關係，緊跟兩國關係提質升級步伐，在高層交往、聯合演習和訓練等領域成果豐碩，願同俄方一道深入貫徹兩國元首重要共識，持續加強戰略溝通，更好捍衛各自國家主權、安全和發展利益，有力維護世界和地區和平穩定。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RUS-2300-1_CLEAN_20261103_211538_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SFgAg8PwTC1793712101.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>別洛烏索夫說，俄中戰略協作達到前所未有的高水平，俄方願同中方繼續密切協作，加強戰略磋商，堅定相互支持，拓展各領域務實合作，推動兩國兩軍關係發展取得更多成果。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RUS-2300-1_CLEAN_20261103_211538_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HZw2Q0Xtap1793712119.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:41:31.941880+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:28.140758+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:38:32.306190+00:00","content_hash":"65158ecc90480b3f619dd5fc3368add15454831bae9edf5c18e24889de647d3d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}